sequenceDiagram
  participant api as API request
  participant database as PostgreSQL
  participant worker as Outbox worker
  participant handler as Idempotent handler
  api->>database: Write domain state and outbox event in one transaction
  database-->>api: Commit both records atomically
  worker->>database: Claim due rows using a lease and SKIP LOCKED
  database-->>worker: Return claimed event IDs and payloads
  worker->>handler: Dispatch event with stable event ID
  handler-->>worker: Acknowledge success or retryable failure
  worker->>database: Mark delivered, schedule retry, or move exhausted event to dead state
